    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Faqmate is a simple and customizable FAQ block for WordPress Gutenberg. Easily add, edit, and style your frequently asked questions with accordion effects.</p>\n<h3>Key Features of Faqmate</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Easy to add FAQs</li>\n<li>Accordion style display</li>\n<li>Fully responsive</li>\n<li>Customizable design</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<p>This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/faqmate</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='are%20the%20blocks%20responsive%3F'>\nAre the blocks Responsive?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, the blocks are responsive.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='are%20they%20optimized%20for%20speed%3F'>\nAre they optimized for Speed?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, they are optimized for speed.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated Tested up to WordPress 6.8</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<p>*updated block</p>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<p>*fix error</p>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<p>*recovery block problem solve now</p>\n"
    },
